{"4464380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stellar Fixer", "steam_appid": 4464380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/dcf7b764bc1222f66c46d2a8ed5bc40e.avif?t=1775328733\" width=780 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/3d807aededf34bb9bb4df31263986469.poster.avif?t=1775328733\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/3d807aededf34bb9bb4df31263986469.webm?t=1775328733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/3d807aededf34bb9bb4df31263986469.mp4?t=1775328733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of <strong>Stellar Fixer</strong>, you aren’t a space explorer or a galactic hero. You are a cog in the A-Log corporate machine. Your home is a flickering space station - BLOK-08, your only friend is a high-torque automatic drill, and your goal is simple: survive the shift and chip away at your mounting debt. When the docking clamps engage, your work begins. Pay off the debt or… rebel against corporation. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/2481f6fed60d8524af7ea2d38d6f8966.avif?t=1775328733\" width=780 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/64928e5828b584a2dab63d6523a6dd53.poster.avif?t=1775328733\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/64928e5828b584a2dab63d6523a6dd53.webm?t=1775328733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/64928e5828b584a2dab63d6523a6dd53.mp4?t=1775328733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Forget &quot;press E to repair.&quot; <strong>Experience a physical, hands-on simulation</strong>. Use your <strong>A-Log Vortex Drill</strong> to unbolt panels and watch as it automatically sucks up the screws. Manually haul heavy filters, slot in fuel cells, and feel the satisfying <i>clunk</i> of a component locking into place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/eaa16d77a8ff74868eb050c4bbf28767.avif?t=1775328733\" width=780 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/bbf7f88caa4f7fe4294402b18a12f4c3.poster.avif?t=1775328733\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/bbf7f88caa4f7fe4294402b18a12f4c3.webm?t=1775328733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/bbf7f88caa4f7fe4294402b18a12f4c3.mp4?t=1775328733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peel back the hull with your handheld scanner to find the root of the problem. Is it a blown fuse or a fractured combustion chamber? Follow environmental cues: a dead reactor plunges the ship into pitch blackness, while a failing life-support system fills the corridors with choking smoke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/457888d38d6f1bb6049264efa0c5a361.avif?t=1775328733\" width=780 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Ships in Stellar Fixer are living, breathing machines. Fixing the generator restores power to the cockpit, allowing you to run the final ignition sequence. Every part exists in three distinct states: <strong>New, Worn, or Broken</strong>—your choices determine if a ship clears the hangar or becomes a drifting tomb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/d4580637aea1f0aae1bf6619d7ccf2a2.avif?t=1775328733\" width=780 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Manage your workflow from your retro-terminal. As a Patcher, you’ll <strong>accept high-stakes contracts</strong>, <strong>order new ship parts</strong>, and track your delivery calendar. Every credit earned is a step toward freedom—or just another day of keeping the lights on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/b2686e7a0a94074cd4e0a29d6725fd97.avif?t=1775328733\" width=780 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lose yourself in a world of clunky 80s tech and industrial grime. The hum of CRT monitors, the hiss of hydraulic airlocks, and the low thrum of the station’s reactor create a thick, atmospheric experience where every repair feels like a mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/3fbe99da66faebb1200bbec966de11e3.avif?t=1775328733\" width=780 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Forget static missions. Thanks to <strong>procedural damage generation system,</strong> every ship that docks at your bay is a unique technical puzzle. One 'Rusty Bucket' might have a simple blown fuse, while the next is a smoke-filled deathtrap with a cracked reactor core. Master the systems, but expect the unexpected—no two jobs are ever the same, offering <strong>endless replayability.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/dcf7b764bc1222f66c46d2a8ed5bc40e.avif?t=1775328733\" width=780 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/3d807aededf34bb9bb4df31263986469.poster.avif?t=1775328733\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/3d807aededf34bb9bb4df31263986469.webm?t=1775328733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/3d807aededf34bb9bb4df31263986469.mp4?t=1775328733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of <strong>Stellar Fixer</strong>, you aren’t a space explorer or a galactic hero. You are a cog in the A-Log corporate machine. Your home is a flickering space station - BLOK-08, your only friend is a high-torque automatic drill, and your goal is simple: survive the shift and chip away at your mounting debt. When the docking clamps engage, your work begins. Pay off the debt or… rebel against corporation. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/2481f6fed60d8524af7ea2d38d6f8966.avif?t=1775328733\" width=780 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/64928e5828b584a2dab63d6523a6dd53.poster.avif?t=1775328733\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/64928e5828b584a2dab63d6523a6dd53.webm?t=1775328733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/64928e5828b584a2dab63d6523a6dd53.mp4?t=1775328733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Forget &quot;press E to repair.&quot; <strong>Experience a physical, hands-on simulation</strong>. Use your <strong>A-Log Vortex Drill</strong> to unbolt panels and watch as it automatically sucks up the screws. Manually haul heavy filters, slot in fuel cells, and feel the satisfying <i>clunk</i> of a component locking into place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/eaa16d77a8ff74868eb050c4bbf28767.avif?t=1775328733\" width=780 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/bbf7f88caa4f7fe4294402b18a12f4c3.poster.avif?t=1775328733\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/bbf7f88caa4f7fe4294402b18a12f4c3.webm?t=1775328733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/bbf7f88caa4f7fe4294402b18a12f4c3.mp4?t=1775328733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peel back the hull with your handheld scanner to find the root of the problem. Is it a blown fuse or a fractured combustion chamber? Follow environmental cues: a dead reactor plunges the ship into pitch blackness, while a failing life-support system fills the corridors with choking smoke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/457888d38d6f1bb6049264efa0c5a361.avif?t=1775328733\" width=780 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Ships in Stellar Fixer are living, breathing machines. Fixing the generator restores power to the cockpit, allowing you to run the final ignition sequence. Every part exists in three distinct states: <strong>New, Worn, or Broken</strong>—your choices determine if a ship clears the hangar or becomes a drifting tomb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/d4580637aea1f0aae1bf6619d7ccf2a2.avif?t=1775328733\" width=780 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Manage your workflow from your retro-terminal. As a Patcher, you’ll <strong>accept high-stakes contracts</strong>, <strong>order new ship parts</strong>, and track your delivery calendar. Every credit earned is a step toward freedom—or just another day of keeping the lights on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/b2686e7a0a94074cd4e0a29d6725fd97.avif?t=1775328733\" width=780 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lose yourself in a world of clunky 80s tech and industrial grime. The hum of CRT monitors, the hiss of hydraulic airlocks, and the low thrum of the station’s reactor create a thick, atmospheric experience where every repair feels like a mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/extras/3fbe99da66faebb1200bbec966de11e3.avif?t=1775328733\" width=780 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Forget static missions. Thanks to <strong>procedural damage generation system,</strong> every ship that docks at your bay is a unique technical puzzle. One 'Rusty Bucket' might have a simple blown fuse, while the next is a smoke-filled deathtrap with a cracked reactor core. Master the systems, but expect the unexpected—no two jobs are ever the same, offering <strong>endless replayability.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Step into the grease-stained boots of a debt-ridden Patcher in a gritty industrial space station. Diagnose critical failures, strip panels with your automatic vortex drill, and replace complex components to bring massive ships back to life. Restore power, clear the smoke, and pay off your debt.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Polish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/cd054408cac3df7551b4ab47fed2aa6acec55a2b/header.jpg?t=1775328733", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/bbae3fa2da36332f586b78f25a6435cc85efb737/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775328733", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/bbae3fa2da36332f586b78f25a6435cc85efb737/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775328733", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-10700K / AMD Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Silent Satellite"], "publishers": ["Silent Satellite"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 80, "description": "#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 79, "description": "Save Anytime"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/0926db701266de0ea71af288303c854b796e48af/ss_0926db701266de0ea71af288303c854b796e48af.600x338.jpg?t=1775328733", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464380/0926db701266de0ea71af288303c854b796e48af/ss_0926db701266de0ea